her job is freelancer. Since position 1 is the videographer, position 2 must be the freelancer.\n- Position 2: Job = freelancer\n\n#### Movie-Genre:\nPosition 1 cannot be animation (since position 2 is animation), so position 1 must be thriller.\n- Position 1: Movie-Genre = thriller\n\n#### Nationality:\nThe only other nationality is Nigerian. Since position 2 is Pakistani, position 1 must be Nigerian.\n- Position 1: Nationality = nigerian\n\n### Step 4: Answer the questions\nNow we have the complete attributes:\n- **Person 1 (Position 1):**\n  - Job: videographer\n  - Movie-Genre: thriller\n  - Nationality: nigerian\n- **Person 2 (Position 2):**\n  - Job: freelancer\n  - Movie-Genre: animation\n  - Nationality: pakistani\n\n#### Questions:\n1. What is the job of the person who is Pakistani?\n   - Position 2 is Pakistani and their job is freelancer.\n\n2. What is the movie genre of the person who is Pakistani?\n   - Position 2 is Pakistani and their movie genre is animation.\n\n3. What movie genre does the person in position 1 watch?\n   - Position 1 watches thriller.\n\n4. At what position is the person who is a videographer?\n   - The videographer is in position 1.\n\n### Final answer:\n<solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.29888519644737244}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.024908771738409996}, {"token": " break", "logprob": -1.0404311418533325}, {"token": " down", "logprob": -0.20462356507778168}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.022575635462999344}, {"token": " problem", "logprob": -0.07506551593542099}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -0.102035753428936}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -0.0789506658911705}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -0.0013831820106133819}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -4.235349178314209}, {"token": " We", "logprob": -0.40162715315818787}, {"token": " have", "logprob": -0.011905918829143047}, {"token": " two", "logp